## Attribution Requirements

When using these files, proper attribution must be given as specified by the CC-BY 4.0 license.

## Purpose

These audio files are included for:
- Integration testing of audio decoders (WAV, MP3, OGG, AIFF)
- Testing audio resampling functionality
- Performance profiling and benchmarking
- Example code demonstrations

Not intended for distribution or commercial use beyond testing this library.
